      },
      {
        "text": "There has been significant pushback against these community-level initiatives from law enforcement.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The People's Act involves bringing on social workers instead of immediately turning to police.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Many local communities have discussed similar approaches involving social workers rather than immediate police response.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
