        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Public funding should align with demonstrated effectiveness and accountability.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Different professions require specialized competencies that cannot be substituted.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "It is morally wrong to assign tasks to unqualified individuals when qualified alternatives exist.",
